# Code Review

When reviewing diffs or PRs, follow `skills/rules/05-code-review.md`.

## Order

1. Scope → 2. Blockers (boundaries, deep imports, MCP layering) → 3. Conventions → 4. Behavior → 5. Tests

## Blockers (must fix)

- Deep imports (`@portfolio/*/src/...`, `feature/model.ts` from outside)
- Wrong dependency direction (`packages → apps`, `web → api`)
- Business logic in MCP tool handlers (belongs in `@portfolio/domain`)
- Accidental public API expansion

## Output

Markdown table: **Severity | Location | Finding | Suggestion** — blockers first.

Approve only with zero blockers and zero unresolved majors.

See `skills/rules/05-code-review.md`.
